segment.source:
::He unsticks his face from the counter, observes you briefly and unsteadily, and then grins from ear to ear.::

Heya, ::hic:: shroom... uh... cake. Where've ya been... h-h-hidin' all this time? Oohooh-oh, yer such a... fetchin' one. *F-fetchin'*. As fetchin'... ::hic:: as a hhhhhhot, mnnnn, juicy, nnnnnhh, b-bouncy *woman*! 

Oh, yeah...&lt;end&gt;

